verses.raw_usfm:
But let our strength be a law of righteousness;  
\q2 for that which is weak is proven useless.   
\q1

Thus they reasoned, and they were led astray;  
\q2 for their wickedness blinded them,   
\q1

Because God created man for incorruption,  
\q2 and made him an image of his own everlastingness;   
\q1
